lrh(federo sepolicy base): HGY arm native, Lemans HGY LV PVM(yocto), Monaco HGY LV PVM(yocto)
common(refpolicy base): Lemans HQX LV GVM(yocto)
qpolicy(refpolicy base): Lemans HQX LV GVM(yocto)

policies in common will append to base policy of refpolicy, patches to refpolicy should put here
policies in qpolicy is a dependent layer in refpolicy when build, new rules for qcom components should put here

federo sepolicy base(for RedHat):
git clone https://github.com/fedora-selinux/selinux-policy.git

refpolicy base(generic):
git clone https://github.com/SELinuxProject/refpolicy.git
